<title>UK: EIB sets NZ$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets NZ$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto Dominion Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    03.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.63    PAY DATE    03.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN OFFERING CIRCULAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
